markdown-doc: /usr/local/bin/markdown-doc
markdown-doc toolkit

Usage: markdown-doc <COMMAND>

Commands:
  catalog   Generate the unified documentation catalog
  lint      Run lint rules
  validate  Validate documentation against schemas
  toc       Synchronise table-of-contents blocks
  refs      List references to files or anchors
  mv        Move or rename a Markdown file and update references
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
WCTL_DOC_LINT_CMD:
wctl doc-lint: AVAILABLE
